      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buckow_(Berlin)",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Buckow is uniquely divided by the Gropiusstadt housing estate, creating an exclave known as Buckow‑II separated from the mainland.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
